      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "of your destiny. I'm sorry,",
      "translation" : "命中注定。抱歉，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "but it seems there is nothing",
      "translation" : "我似乎帮不了"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I can do for you.",
      "translation" : "你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[剑士公会职员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This is the Swordman Guild.",
      "translation" : "这里是剑士公会。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why are you here?",
      "translation" : "你来这里做什么？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Tell me about being a Swordman.",
      "translation" : "告诉我剑士的事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I want to be a Swordman.",
      "translation" : "我想成为剑士。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Nothing.",
      "translation" : "没事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[剑士公会职员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So you wish to know more about the mighty Swordman? Okay!",
      "translation" : "想了解强大的剑士？好啊！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[剑士公会职员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The most distinctive feature of the Swordman is that the Swordman can show us his/her real abilities in close combat.",
      "translation" : "剑士最突出的特点是，他们能在近身战斗中发挥真正的实力。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There are three reasons!",
      "translation" : "原因有三点！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[剑士公会职员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "First, Swordman has higher HP than other jobs.",
      "translation" : "第一，剑士的HP比其他职业高。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Second, except for Bows and Rods, Swordman can use all other weapons so they can fight at their optimal ability.",
      "translation" : "第二，除了弓和手杖，剑士可以使用其他所有武器，因此能发挥出最佳战力。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And third, most of the skills of the Swordman give powerful physical attacks.",
      "translation" : "第三，剑士的大多数技能都能发动强力的物理攻击。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[剑士公会职员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Though I gave you a simple explanation, I believe you understand the core meaning of what it is to be a Swordman.",
      "translation" : "虽然我只是简单介绍了一下，但我相信你已经明白剑士的核心特点。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "In my opinion, Swordman is the best job ever!",
      "translation" : "在我看来，剑士是最棒的职业！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[剑士公会职员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You are already an excellent Swordman, aren't you?",
      "translation" : "你已经是个出色的剑士了，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Just devote yourself to be a great Swordman.",
      "translation" : "只管专心成为一名伟大的剑士。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You already have one of the other jobs, don't you?",
      "translation" : "你已经有其他职业了，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You've gone too far with that joke.",
      "translation" : "这个玩笑开得太过分了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry to tell you this but to be a Swordman, you must reach at least ^4A4AFFJob Level 10^000000.",
      "translation" : "很抱歉，想成为剑士，至少必须达到^4A4AFF职业等级10^000000，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "and ^4A4AFFBasic Skill Level 9^000000.",
      "translation" : "并且达到^4A4AFF基本技能等级9^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[剑士公会职员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Want to be a Swordman without having the minimum requirement?",
      "translation" : "还没达到最低要求就想成为剑士？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do you think being a Swordman is that easy?",
      "translation" : "你以为剑士这么容易当吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm, both your Job Level and Basic Skill Level check out.",
      "translation" : "嗯，你的职业等级和基本技能等级都符合要求。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Good. Do you want to be a Swordman right away?",
      "translation" : "很好。现在就转职为剑士吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, I do.",
      "translation" : "是的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll consider it again.",
      "translation" : "我再考虑一下。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[剑士公会职员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yeah. Prudent decision is needed for choosing a job.",
      "translation" : "嗯，选择职业时应该谨慎。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But I feel sorry... that you consider it again after overcoming all the hardships....",
      "translation" : "不过你克服了那么多困难之后，竟然又要重新考虑...我真替你惋惜。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[剑士公会职员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Congratulations! From now on, you are going to live a Swordman's life!",
      "translation" : "恭喜！从现在起，你将踏上剑士之路！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Let's do it right now!",
      "translation" : "现在就开始吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman Guildsman]",
      "translation" : "[剑士公会职员]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Congratulations again for being a Swordman and I hope that you participate in many activities for the revival of our guild.",
      "translation" : "再次恭喜你成为剑士！希望你积极参与公会复兴活动。"
    }
  ]
